{"id":"cb6c4f5943f5740e","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-provable.md","title":"可证","display":"df-provable — 可证","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-provable","aliases":["29-df-provable"],"display":"df-provable — 可证","depends_on":["[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-theory]]"],"source_locator":"Local parameterized proof interface; Theorem1.34 p.21 scan36 does not specify this calculus"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-provable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-provable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provable — 可证"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bbdc67d0a260ff0\" href=\"?note=2bbdc67d0a260ff0\" title=\"29-df-theory\">29-df-theory</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Local parameterized proof interface; Theorem1.34 p.21 scan36 does not specify this calculus"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-provable-—-可证-$\\vdash$\">df-provable — 可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\">\\(\\vdash\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为有限词汇，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K=(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K},\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K})\">\\(\\mathcal K=(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K},\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K})\\)</span> 是明确给定的句子演算参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>；本定义不假定任意演算均可靠或完备。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为非空有限证明序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\">\\(\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\)</span> 为有限序列分量集。无下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span> 仅在当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\">\\(\\mathcal K\\)</span> 固定时使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal K}(T,\\pi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\pi|&gt;0\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\;\\left(\\pi_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K}\\lor\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl((\\rho,\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K}\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\pi_j=\\psi\\bigr)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal K}(T,\\pi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\pi|&gt;0\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\pi|\\;\\left(\\pi_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K}\\lor\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\bigl((\\rho,\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K}\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;\\exists j&lt;i\\;\\pi_j=\\psi\\bigr)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal K}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal K}(T,\\pi)\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\varphi),\\qquad T\\vdash\\varphi\\coloneqq T\\vdash_{\\mathcal K}\\varphi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T\\vdash_{\\mathcal K}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal K}(T,\\pi)\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\varphi),\\qquad T\\vdash\\varphi\\coloneqq T\\vdash_{\\mathcal K}\\varphi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地通用句子演算定义。规则与公理是显式外部参数，ProofSeq由有限逐步条件定义，不再把未分型的ProofSeq/last名字当成完整证明论。原书Theorem1.34的递归公理化存在性另由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c05483682bbb72c7\" href=\"?note=c05483682bbb72c7\" title=\"29-thm-fo-completeness\">29-thm-fo-completeness</a> 陈述；本条没有指定标准一阶演算，也不能独立推出其可靠性、完备性或证明检查可判定性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-provable-—-可证-$\\vdash$","text":"df-provable — 可证 $\\vdash$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"2bbdc67d0a260ff0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-thm-fo-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"c05483682bbb72c7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"本地通用句子演算定义。规则与公理是显式外部参数，ProofSeq由有限逐步条件定义，不再把未分型的ProofSeq/last名字当成完整证明论。原书Theorem1.34的递归公理化存在性另由 [[29-thm-fo-completeness]] 陈述；本条没有指定标准一阶演算，也不能独立推出其可靠性、完备性或证明检查可判定性。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\vdash","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K=(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K},\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{<\\omega}\\times\\mathrm{Sent}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal K}(T,\\pi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\pi|>0\\land\\forall i<|\\pi|\\;\\left(\\pi_i\\in T\\cup\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathcal K}\\lor\\exists\\rho\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{<\\omega}\\;\\bigl((\\rho,\\pi_i)\\in\\mathrm{Rule}_{\\mathcal K}\\land\\forall\\psi\\in\\operatorname{rng}(\\rho)\\;\\exists j<i\\;\\pi_j=\\psi\\bigr)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"T\\vdash_{\\mathcal K}\\varphi\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\pi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S^{<\\omega}\\;(\\operatorname{ProofSeq}_{\\mathcal K}(T,\\pi)\\land\\pi_{|\\pi|-1}=\\varphi),\\qquad T\\vdash\\varphi\\coloneqq T\\vdash_{\\mathcal K}\\varphi.","display":true}],"bytes":1924,"backlinks":[{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-113","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-provable]]"}],"outgoing":["711217f22972ffc0","2bbdc67d0a260ff0","c05483682bbb72c7"]}